<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ragflow on 老衲法号蛋哥</title><link>https://laonafahaodange.github.io/tags/ragflow/</link><description>Recent content in Ragflow on 老衲法号蛋哥</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>老衲法号蛋哥</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 18:07:50 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://laonafahaodange.github.io/tags/ragflow/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>【实践】Ubuntu20.04 Ollama+Ragflow Docker部署遇到的问题</title><link>https://laonafahaodange.github.io/p/practice-20250331/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Mar 2025 18:07:50 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://laonafahaodange.github.io/p/practice-20250331/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://laonafahaodange.github.io/p/practice-20250331/cover.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 【实践】Ubuntu20.04 Ollama+Ragflow Docker部署遇到的问题" />&lt;h1 id="ubuntu2004-ragflow">Ubuntu20.04 Ragflow
&lt;/h1>&lt;h2 id="运行-ragflow">运行 Ragflow
&lt;/h2>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">7
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-SHELL" data-lang="SHELL">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">git clone https://github.com/infiniflow/ragflow.git
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># check the value of vm.max_map_count&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">sysctl vm.max_map_count
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1"># Reset vm.max_map_count to a value at least 262144 if it is not.&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">sudo sysctl -w vm.max_map_count&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">262144&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">cd&lt;/span> ragflow/docker
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">docker compose -f docker-compose.yml up -d
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>问题:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-zed" data-lang="zed">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">WARN&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">0000&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">The&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">HF_ENDPOINT&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">variable&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">is&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">not&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">set&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">Defaulting&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">to&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">blank&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">string&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">WARN&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">0000&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">The&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">MACOS&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">variable&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">is&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">not&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">set&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">Defaulting&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">to&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">blank&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">string&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">unable&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">to&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">get&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">image&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nn">infiniflow/&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">ragflow&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">v0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">17&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">slim&lt;/span>&lt;span class="err">&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="kd">permission&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">denied&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">while&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">trying&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">to&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">connect&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">to&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">the&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">Docker&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">daemon&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">socket&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">at&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">unix&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="c1">///var/run/docker.sock: Get &amp;#34;http://%2Fvar%2Frun%2Fdocker.sock/v1.48/images/infiniflow/ragflow:v0.17.2-slim/json&amp;#34;: dial unix /var/run/docker.sock: connect: permission denied
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>解决方案:&lt;br>
修改 &lt;code>.env&lt;/code> 文件&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">RAGFLOW_IMAGE=registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/infiniflow/ragflow:nightly-slim
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>执行&lt;code>docker compose -f docker-compose.yml up -d&lt;/code>前应该加上&lt;code>sudo&lt;/code>&lt;br>
此时又出现另外的问题：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Error response from daemon: failed to set up container networking: driver failed programming external connectivity on endpoint ragflow-server (a3b939ad7640ae72035b928e912fcae6dddf16255151ca80a62d22d8760a0e49): Bind for 0.0.0.0:80 failed: port is already allocated
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>可能是因为我以docker方式运行了ragflow&amp;hellip;?&lt;/p>
&lt;p>解决方案:&lt;br>
修改 &lt;code>ragflow-main\docker\docker-compose.yml&lt;/code> 中关于 &lt;code>ports&lt;/code> 的部分&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># from
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ports:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> - ${SVR_HTTP_PORT}:9380
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> - 80:80
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> - 443:443
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># to
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ports:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> - ${SVR_HTTP_PORT}:9380
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> - 8880:80
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> - 4443:443
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>url: &lt;code>http://localhost:8880/login&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="运行-ollama">运行 Ollama
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>我改变了&lt;code>port&lt;/code>端口号然后发现一些问题，下面是我的ollama service config文件：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">15
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">16
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">[Unit]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Description=Ollama Service
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">After=network-online.target
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">[Service]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ExecStart=/usr/bin/ollama serve
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">User=ollama
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Group=ollama
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Restart=always
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">RestartSec=3
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Environment=&amp;#34;PATH=$PATH&amp;#34;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">Environment=&amp;#34;OLLAMA_HOST=0.0.0.0:11451&amp;#34;
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">OLLAMA_SCHED_SPREAD=1
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">[Install]
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">WantedBy=default.target
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>我需要以这样的方式运行ollama：&lt;code>OLLAMA_HOST=127.0.0.1:11451 ollama run qwq&lt;/code>，这是可行的，但是还不清楚原因。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>还需要一个嵌入模型：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nv">OLLAMA_HOST&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>127.0.0.1:11451 ollama pull shaw/dmeta-embedding-zh
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>但是还是无法配置ragflow页面中的嵌入模型。&lt;br>
尝试修改 &lt;code>.env&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># from
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">RAGFLOW_IMAGE=registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/infiniflow/ragflow:v0.17.2-slim
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"># to
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">RAGFLOW_IMAGE=registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/infiniflow/ragflow:v0.17.2
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;hr>
